   },
   {
    "choice": [
     {
      "key": "acc_who_nikolai",
      "auto_rank": 3,
      "do": [
       {
        "say": "narrator",
        "key": "acc_why"
       },
       {
        "choice": [
         {
          "menu": "Still beside him. Which is the part nobody wants to talk about, so let us not.",
          "if_flag": "heard_nik3_folder",
          "auto_rank": 0,
          "do": [
           {
            "flag": "c3_cleared"
           },
           {
            "flag": "c3_done"
           },
           {
            "hide_cg": true
           },
           {
            "bg": "interview"
           },
           {
            "lines": "board:197-198"
           },
           {
            "xp": 60
           },
           {
            "event": "c3_epilogue"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "menu": "It has been dying for two years. Three deaths is not a run of luck, it is a diagnosis.",
          "if_flag": "heard_nik3_paloma",
          "auto_rank": 0,
          "do": [
           {
            "flag": "c3_cleared"
           },
           {
            "flag": "c3_done"
           },
           {
            "hide_cg": true
           },
           {
            "bg": "interview"
           },
           {
            "lines": "board:197-198"
           },
           {
            "xp": 60
           },
           {
            "event": "c3_epilogue"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "menu": "Open, I'm told. Money still in it, I'm told. You keep handing me facts I am supposed to find surprising.",
          "if_flag": "heard_nik3_safe",
          "auto_rank": 0,
          "do": [
           {
            "flag": "c3_cleared"
           },
           {
            "flag": "c3_done"
           },
           {
            "hide_cg": true
           },
           {
            "bg": "interview"
           },
           {
            "lines": "board:197-198"
           },
           {
            "xp": 60
           },
           {
            "event": "c3_epilogue"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "menu": "Nothing in that safe was worth a life. The money, I mean. The money was never the thing. The inner drawer is the thing, and you already know it was the ledger in there and not a single note, or you would not have come back a third time.",
          "if_flag": "heard_nik3_drawer",
          "auto_rank": 3,
          "do": [
           {
            "flag": "c3_clean"
           },
           {
            "flag": "c3_cleared"
           },
           {
            "flag": "c3_done"
           },
           {
            "hide_cg": true
           },
           {
            "bg": "interview"
           },
           {
            "music": "boss"
           },
           {
            "show": "nikolai",
            "x": 0.72
           },
           {
            "lines": "board:178-184"
           },
           {
            "show": ""
           },
           {
            "cg": "cg_closing"
           },
           {
            "lines": "board:187-187"
           },
           {
            "say": "narrator",
            "key": "end_clean_c3"
           },
           {
            "xp": 150
           },
           {
            "event": "c3_epilogue"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "menu": "Because I am the only one of the three who has never once asked you for anything. You should have found that strange a long time ago.",
          "if_flag": "heard_nik3_tired",
          "auto_rank": 0,
          "do": [
           {
            "flag": "c3_cleared"
           },
           {
            "flag": "c3_done"
           },
           {
            "hide_cg": true
           },
           {
            "bg": "interview"
           },
           {
            "lines": "board:197-198"
           },
           {
            "xp": 60
